    "# Fraud Detection - Unified EKS Demo\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates the complete fraud detection pipeline using both EMR on EKS and Ray on EKS.\n",
    "It showcases the unified notebook experience where data scientists can seamlessly switch between\n",
    "Spark (EMR on EKS) for data processing and Ray for ML training and inference.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Pipeline Overview:\n",
    "1. **Data Processing**: EMR on EKS with Spark RAPIDS for feature engineering\n",
    "2. **ML Training**: Ray on EKS with distributed XGBoost training\n",
    "3. **Model Inference**: Ray Serve for scalable model serving\n",
    "\n",
    "## Prerequisites:\n",
    "- EKS cluster with EMR on EKS and Ray cluster deployed\n",
    "- JupyterHub running with appropriate service account (IRSA for S3 access)\n",
    "- Environment variables configured for EMR and Ray connectivity"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
